<title>AUSTRIA: Austria cenbank calls for repo bids at 3.0 pct.</title>
<headline>Austria cenbank calls for repo bids at 3.0 pct.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Austrian National Bank on Thursday said it was calling for bids on one-week repurchase agreements at a fixed rate of 3.0 percent, unchanged from last week.</p>
<p>Bids have to be in by 1200 GMT on Friday.</p>
<p>Last week, the central bank allotted 11.12 billion schillings, or 12 percent of bids, in one-week repos. -- Vienna newsroom +431 53112 274</p>
